URL: https://ftpmirror.gnu.org/gzip/gzip-1.15.tar.gz 3cbe9101598ebf6e2525578fd2f1218c00bbbefe8667f12417ac0cc9250948fc
Origname: gzip-1.15
Name: gzip

    gzip 1.15 with no Fil-C changes.  This used to be consumed as the raw
    pizlix/gzip-1.14.tar.xz tarball; it is now a URL-based projeny project
    so that the pizlix tarball convention can be retired for it.  The
    pizlix prelc (cross-toolchain, pre-Fil-C) build of gzip still uses the
    raw pizlix tarball, since pizlonated tarballs cannot exist at that
    stage.
